## At the end of each sprint

Run an after-action review of the sprint and file each gap with the [sprint-feedback form](https://github.com/CUPIDS-Lab/data-skills/issues/new?template=sprint-feedback.yml), against the Outline section numbers. Private projects report process lessons only: no data values, names or record details.
